# --- Private build files: PUBLIC REPO ME KABHI MAT DALNA ---
# Inme release signing key aur Firebase config hai. Agar ye dobara repo me
# aa gayi to koi bhi aapki tarah signed APK bana sakta hai. CI inhe GitHub
# Actions ke secrets se likhta hai (release.yml ka "Reveal private build
# files" step); laptop par ye files isi jagah rakhi hain.
/android/key.properties
/android/app/*.p12
/android/app/google-services.json
# Asli .env (Gemini key) ka backup - .env khud tracked hai par placeholder.
/.env.local

